          "title": "Test cases",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "One case per behaviour. Steps are numbered, each step is one action, and the expected result is written before the run, not after. Example steps: \"1. Open the sign-in page. 2. Enter a valid user name and a wrong password. 3. Press Sign in.\""
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "columns": [
                "ID",
                "Title",
                "Preconditions",
                "Steps",
                "Test data",
                "Expected result",
                "Actual result",
